    "body": "> I'd be fine with either resolution, but as long as it is consistent with how with handle other things, e.g. in https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/6939#issuecomment-1016679588 we decided that modal dialogs escape visibility: hidden on ancestors (which only WebKit implements atm), so logically it should escape inert. As long everything is consistent for web developers, I'm fine with it.\r\n\r\nI agree. Given that WebKit / Gecko behavior here seems preferable.",
