    "created_at": "2024-03-15T06:00:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-03-15T06:00:35Z",
    "body": "> So my vote is to make <dialog> escape inert.\r\n\r\nSo should we do the same for elements that have the popover attribute added?",
    "author_association": "NONE",
